<DigitalTwin />
<section class="usecases" aria-labelledby="usecases-title">
<div class="uc-top">
<h2 id="usecases-title">Use cases for the sites you run</h2>
<p class="uc-lead">One connected system for facilities, assets, and the teams on site.</p>
</div>
<div class="cs" aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="Use cases">
<div class="cs__stage" id="csStage" tabindex="0">
<article class="cs-card" data-href="/stories/asset-management">
<div class="cs-card__dim"></div>
<div class="cs-card__body">
<span class="cs-card__badge">Assets</span>
<div class="cs-card__text">
<p class="cs-card__title"><span class="uc-p">50,000+</span> assets traced. A full audit now takes <span class="uc-g">30 minutes.</span></p>
<p class="cs-card__desc">Every asset was mapped to one purchase order and invoice, then tagged with RFID.</p>
<dl class="cs-stats">
<div><b class="uc-p">50,000+</b><span>assets digitized and RFID-tagged</span></div>
<div><b class="uc-g">30 min</b><span>full audit, down from 15 days</span></div>
<div><b class="uc-p">60%</b><span>lower warehouse rental</span></div>
<div><b class="uc-g">4,120</b><span>ghost assets removed from the books</span></div>
</dl>
</div>
</div>
</article>
<article class="cs-card" data-href="/stories/facility-operations">
<div class="cs-card__dim"></div>
<div class="cs-card__body">
<span class="cs-card__badge">Campuses</span>
<div class="cs-card__text">
<p class="cs-card__title"><span class="uc-p">14 campuses.</span> One way of working, and more of the <span class="uc-g">power cost recovered.</span></p>
<p class="cs-card__desc">The same SOPs, asset history, and timed readings now run on every campus.</p>
<dl class="cs-stats">
<div><b class="uc-p">96%</b><span>PPM tasks done on time, up from 52%</span></div>
<div><b class="uc-g">45%</b><span>fewer unplanned breakdowns</span></div>
<div><b class="uc-p">18%</b><span>more electricity cost recovered</span></div>
<div><b class="uc-g">5 days</b><span>to set up a new campus, down from 3 weeks</span></div>
</dl>
</div>
</div>
</article>
<article class="cs-card" data-href="/stories/pantry">
<div class="cs-card__dim"></div>
<div class="cs-card__body">
<span class="cs-card__badge">Pantry</span>
<div class="cs-card__text">
<p class="cs-card__title">Pantry orders that took <span class="uc-p">22 minutes</span> now arrive in <span class="uc-g">8.</span></p>
<p class="cs-card__desc">A QR code at each pantry and meeting room replaced the call. No app to download.</p>
<dl class="cs-stats">
<div><b class="uc-p">8 min</b><span>average delivery, down from 22 minutes</span></div>
<div><b class="uc-g">97%</b><span>orders delivered on time, up from 68%</span></div>
<div><b class="uc-p">92%</b><span>fewer escalations to management</span></div>
<div><b class="uc-g">4.6</b><span>employee satisfaction, up from 3.1 out of 5</span></div>
</dl>
</div>
</div>
</article>
<article class="cs-card" data-href="/stories/facility-operations">
<div class="cs-card__dim"></div>
<div class="cs-card__body">
<span class="cs-card__badge">Energy</span>
<div class="cs-card__text">
<p class="cs-card__title">Energy cost is down <span class="uc-g">12%.</span> After-hours power is <span class="uc-p">billed to the tenant.</span></p>
<p class="cs-card__desc">Meter readings left paper and now run at set times through the day.</p>
<dl class="cs-stats">
<div><b class="uc-g">12%</b><span>lower energy bills once spikes were fixed</span></div>
<div><b class="uc-p">9 pm</b><span>cutoff, so after-hours use is measured</span></div>
<div><b class="uc-g">100%</b><span>of meter readings were on paper before</span></div>
<div><b class="uc-p">0%</b><span>of after-hours tenant power was billed before</span></div>
</dl>
</div>
</div>
</article>
<article class="cs-card" data-href="/stories/facility-operations">
<div class="cs-card__dim"></div>
<div class="cs-card__body">
<span class="cs-card__badge">Checklists</span>
<div class="cs-card__text">
<p class="cs-card__title">Cleaning compliance rose from <span class="uc-p">61%</span> to <span class="uc-g">95%.</span></p>
<p class="cs-card__desc">Every campus follows the same schedule, and each task closes with a photo.</p>
<dl class="cs-stats">
<div><b class="uc-g">95%</b><span>checklist compliance, up from 61%</span></div>
<div><b class="uc-p">1 SOP</b><span>replacing 14 different campus routines</span></div>
<div><b class="uc-g">Photo</b><span>proof on every closed task</span></div>
<div><b class="uc-p">10 wks</b><span>to roll the same standard out</span></div>
</dl>
</div>
</div>
</article>
<article class="cs-card" data-href="/stories/pantry">
<div class="cs-card__dim"></div>
<div class="cs-card__body">
<span class="cs-card__badge">Orders</span>
<div class="cs-card__text">
<p class="cs-card__title"><span class="uc-p">300+</span> pantry calls a day fell to <span class="uc-g">almost none.</span></p>
<p class="cs-card__desc">Every order is logged, and a late one escalates on its own.</p>
<dl class="cs-stats">
<div><b class="uc-p">450+</b><span>pantry orders a day across 6 pantries</span></div>
<div><b class="uc-g">3</b><span>escalations a month, down from 40</span></div>
<div><b class="uc-p">18</b><span>meeting rooms, each with its own menu</span></div>
<div><b class="uc-g">25%</b><span>less wastage of milk, snacks and fruit</span></div>
</dl>
</div>
</div>
</article>
<article class="cs-card" data-href="/stories/asset-management">
<div class="cs-card__dim"></div>
<div class="cs-card__body">
<span class="cs-card__badge">Register</span>
<div class="cs-card__text">
<p class="cs-card__title"><span class="uc-p">1,860</span> missing assets found. <span class="uc-g">37</span> were billed more than once.</p>
<p class="cs-card__desc">The books were reconciled to what was actually on the floor.</p>
<dl class="cs-stats">
<div><b class="uc-p">1,860</b><span>assets on site with no record at all</span></div>
<div><b class="uc-g">37</b><span>assets linked to more than one invoice</span></div>
<div><b class="uc-p">1,140</b><span>idle assets cleared for donation or scrap</span></div>
<div><b class="uc-g">8 wks</b><span>from first audit to a clean register</span></div>
</dl>
</div>
</div>
</article>
<article class="cs-card" data-href="/stories/facility-operations">
<div class="cs-card__dim"></div>
<div class="cs-card__body">
<span class="cs-card__badge">Visibility</span>
<div class="cs-card__text">
<p class="cs-card__title"><span class="uc-p">32,000+</span> assets, and every breakdown reaches <span class="uc-g">the central team.</span></p>
<p class="cs-card__desc">Before, only 1 in 3 breakdowns was reported beyond the campus.</p>
<dl class="cs-stats">
<div><b class="uc-p">32,000+</b><span>assets with a service history</span></div>
<div><b class="uc-g">6</b><span>cities on one view of the campuses</span></div>
<div><b class="uc-p">1 in 3</b><span>breakdowns were reported before</span></div>
<div><b class="uc-g">10 wks</b><span>to put every campus on the system</span></div>
</dl>
</div>
</div>
</article>
<div class="cs__drag" id="csDrag" aria-hidden="true"></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="esg-banner" aria-labelledby="esg-title">
<div class="card">
